on mouseUp
  [  0] pushsymb 11 ............................. <#playFile>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  5] getglobal 13 ............................ <effectspath>
  [  7] pushcons 0 .............................. <"page.aif">
  [  9] joinstr ................................. <effectspath & "page.aif">
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 3 ...................... <1, effectspath & "page.aif">
  [ 12] extcall 12 .............................. sound playFile 1, effectspath & "page.aif"
  [ 14] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 16] thebuiltin 6 ............................ <the frame>
  [ 18] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 21] add ..................................... <the frame + 1>
  [ 22] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame + 1>
  [ 24] extcall 2 ............................... go(the frame + 1)
  [ 26] ret
end
